{"title":"2007 JBMO Problems","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Problem_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be positive real number such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/7/7d74121afb82b85afd4a4902e208519cc17aa83f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{3}=6(a+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"19\" />. Prove that the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/9/a692cc9be7a64044ca8771effcbd14fe0199e102.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2}+ax+a^{2}-6=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\" /> has no real solution.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 JBMO Problems/Problem 1\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> be a convex quadrilateral with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/5/a55ebc55eb68924a644773605753defcf65d8071.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{DAC}= \\angle{BDC}= 36^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"190\" height=\"15\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/8/e0884d3de022586a931e71a7e1c97d25e9fbd3c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{CBD}= 18^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/5/f95fb05be898ec9d7c67983964703cef63ef7a6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{BAC}= 72^\\circ$\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" />. The diagonals and intersect at point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> . Determine the measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/2/982639815a9c7d84ed18958a7a169f823b05fcab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{APD}$\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 JBMO Problems/Problem 2\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> points in the plane, no three of them belonging to a same line. Each of these points is colored using one of four given colors. Prove that there is a color and at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/d/7ed053c218042da5437116773b5ec17ac57d8a4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$130$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> scalene triangles with vertices of that color.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 JBMO Problems/Problem 3\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prove that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is a prime number, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/1/aa13febe81592155005aa6d8a405fd0c0b09552b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7p+3^{p}-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" /> is not a perfect square.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 JBMO Problems/Problem 4\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO\" title=\"2007 JBMO\">2007 JBMO</a></b> (<b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13_contests\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_JBMO\" title=\"2006 JBMO\">2006 JBMO</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_JBMO\" title=\"2008 JBMO\">2008 JBMO</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 JBMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 JBMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 JBMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_JBMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 JBMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JBMO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" title=\"JBMO Problems and Solutions, with authors\"> All JBMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018053430\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 106/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 810/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 50/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2296/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.521      1 Template:JBMO_box\n100.00%    6.521      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16661:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018053430 and revision id 216238. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}